[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_1]
New Members

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_1_desc]
All it takes is just a few army officers in a van, with candy and comic books in hoof, driving around the schools in the city, to lure new soldiers. Probably.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_1]
新成员

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_1_desc]
我们大概只需要让一些军官待在货车里，拿着糖果和漫画书，开着车在城市里的学校周围转一圈，就能招募到新的士兵。大概吧。

